/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_TheSingingLute_DraftLyrics01</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_TheSingingLute_DraftLyrics01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_TheSingingLute_DraftLyrics01\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ff289f02-2257-4f7d-8648-d0d92fe7f694</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ff289f02-2257-4f7d-8648-d0d92fe7f694\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ff289f02-2257-4f7d-8648-d0d92fe7f694\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a wooden desk in the bartender room of the <a href=\"/wiki/Singing_Lute\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Singing Lute\">Singing Lute</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-120&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-131</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Below are the scratched-out and oft-amended lyrics to a song meant to be played on the lute]\n</p><p><br>\nPouring swill into the city,\n</p><p>Barman's delight, oh but oh they -\n</p><p>Oh, they see me at the till\n</p><p>But my heart is\n</p><p>still.\n</p><p><br>\nTake me into the night\n</p><p>Far into the under-over-world\n</p><p>I want to be free\n</p><p>I want to be free\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lyrical_Draft\" title=\"Lyrical Draft\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lyrical_Draft\" title=\"Lyrical Draft\">Lyrical Draft</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205919\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1714/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26960/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6627/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua ti